===Etymology===
From {{inh|de|goh|zweinzug}} from an original (pre-High-German-Sound-Shift) *''tweintug'', from {{inh|de|gem-pro|*twaintigaz}}, {{m|gem-pro|*twai tigiwiz}}. Compare {{cog|nl|twintig}}, {{cog|fy|tweintich}}, {{cog|en|twenty}}, {{cog|da|tyve}}.

